Audit Log demonstration script

Recommended duration: 8–10 minutes
Primary objective: Demonstrate audit-log discovery, filtering, validation, pagination, tenant isolation, and the navigation/layout regression fix.

Pre-demo preparation

Use an account with  CAN_VIEW_AUDIT_LOG  and ensure the selected tenant/business unit has records such as:

